      "text": "\u26a0\ufe0f BOTTLENECK: SEQUENTIAL API CALLS\n- Loops 1-by-1 over N segments.\n- Calls Gemini describe_keyframe() N times.\n- Dense sampling for long scenes.\n- synthesize_context() (1 API call)",
