      "text": "\u2705 M4 FIX: PARALLEL BATCHING\n- ThreadPoolExecutor parallel keyframe extraction.\n- Batched Gemini API calls: describe_keyframes_batch().\n- Adaptive dense-sampling floor (20s instead of 10s).\n- synthesize_context()",
