      "text": "\u26a0\ufe0f BOTTLENECK: CONTEXT OVERFLOW\n- Sends entire 200+ segment EGT to Gemini.\n- generate_edl_llm() single massive API call.\n- Fails on long footage (> 50k tokens).\n- enforce_budget() Tier 3 fallback.",
